      "id": "25dc1104-eb40-4926-95c4-f26928ae8de1",
      "name": "Files",
      "description": {
        "content": "Files are objects that represent a file hosted on Increase's servers. The file may have been uploaded by you (for example, when uploading a check image) or it may have been created by Increase (for example, an autogenerated statement PDF). If you need to download a File, create a File Link.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
